     "t": "p",
     "text": "A critical insight emphasized by Ankur Sir is that minimizing gate count alone does NOT guarantee optimal high-speed performance. The internal **path delay ($T_{pd}$)** depends strictly on the number of logic levels traversed by the longest signal path."
