      "Level 1: Gate 1 computes $X = \\overline{AB}$.",
      "Level 2: Gate 2 computes $\\overline{A \\cdot X}$, Gate 3 computes $\\overline{B \\cdot X}$.",
      "Level 3: Gate 4 combines Level 2 outputs to produce $Y = A \\oplus B$.",
      "**Path Delay**: Exactly $\\mathbf{3 t_{pd}}$ (3 propagation delay units)."
